{"id":"37cd2e44802c0a69","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-sgale.md","title":"s-gale","display":"df-sgale — s-gale","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-sgale","aliases":["43-df-sgale"],"display":"df-sgale — s-gale","depends_on":["[[43-df-string]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_locator":"Def.17.2.2, printed p.514 / PDF p.534","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"source_statement_checked":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-sgale"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-sgale</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sgale — s-gale"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1cb4649e6af56ba4\" href=\"?note=1cb4649e6af56ba4\" title=\"43-df-string\">43-df-string</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Def.17.2.2, printed p.514 / PDF p.534"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\">\\(s\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\">\\(d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\)</span>；二进制有限串见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1cb4649e6af56ba4\" href=\"?note=1cb4649e6af56ba4\" title=\"43-df-string\">43-df-string</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Gale}_s(d)\\iff\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\,[2^s d(\\sigma)=d(\\sigma0)+d(\\sigma1)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Gale}_s(d)\\iff\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\,[2^s d(\\sigma)=d(\\sigma0)+d(\\sigma1)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>将原先 s∈[0,1] 改为全部非负 s；虽维数至多1，满维点的成功策略需允许 s&gt;1 后取下确界。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-string","status":"resolved","id":"1cb4649e6af56ba4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-string]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-string","status":"resolved","id":"1cb4649e6af56ba4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$s\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$，$d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$；二进制有限串见 [[43-df-string]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"s\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Gale}_s(d)\\iff\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}\\,[2^s d(\\sigma)=d(\\sigma0)+d(\\sigma1)].","display":true}],"bytes":937,"backlinks":[{"id":"bda505ba94a2dc32","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\mathrm{Gale}_s$、$\\mathrm{Success}^s$ 见 [[43-df-sgale]]、[[43-df-sgale-success]]。$\\mathrm{UniformComputableReal}$ 见 [[43-df-computable-real]]，用于有限串编码上的实值函数。"},{"id":"9049b31bf7443246","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$s\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$，$d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\